   "description": "<p>Job Description\n</p>\n\n<ul><li>Responsible to lead influencer marketing campaigns for clients</li>\n  <li>Create plan and report for influencer marketing campaign</li>\n  <li>Work closely with community officer team in delivering the influencer content</li>\n  <li>Make a good interaction with clients during the campaign process</li>\n  <li>Build a good relationship with client and agency partner</li>\n  <li>Responding to potential clients’ inquiries from multiple lead channel</li>\n</ul><p>Requirement\n</p>\n\n<ul><li>Bachelor's degree in Business, Marketing, Communications, or related field</li>\n  <li>Min. 1 years of similar experience</li>\n  <li>Proven track record of successfully managing campaign</li>\n  <li>Excellent in power point making and Google Sheets</li>\n  <li>Excellent interpersonal skills</li>\n  <li>Highly self-motivated</li>\n  <li>Strong verbal and written communication skills</li>\n  <li>Passionate to marketing strategic planning</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br></p>",
