   "description": "<p><strong>About Timur Media </strong></p>\n<p>As part of a growing digital agency ecosystem that started from a strong creative foundation, our journey began with our sister company, Mediatics, a media buying agency that became the anchor for the development of multiple subsidiaries under one group.</p>\n<p>Today, the group operates under the name Playmakers Group, with 130+ employees and a proven track record of handling leading brands such as Gudang Garam, JTI, Kalbe, Xiaomi, Tecno, Traveloka, Shell, Pristine, and many more.</p>\n<p>Timur Media is the latest initiative from Playmakers Group, focusing on building a dedicated creative agency that delivers impactful and performance driven work.</p>\n<p>With strong backing from the group, Timur Media offers significant growth potential. We are looking to invest in talents who are eager to build, take ownership, and grow together as part of this journey.</p>\n<p><strong>Job Description </strong></p>\n<ul><li>⁠Develop a strong and trusting relationship with the clients and agency partners.</li>\n  <li>Identify solutions to client challenges through a comprehensive 360 digital marketing approach planning, ensuring strategies are data-driven and goal-oriented.</li>\n  <li>⁠Enforcing a comprehensive and clear way to communicate with clients and colleagues, thus creating a delightful working experience.</li>\n  <li>⁠Analyzing campaign performance to produce actionable insights &amp; supervise the optimization process.</li></ul>",
