   "description": "<p>We are seeking a dynamic Delivery Manager (SEO &amp; Digital Marketing) to help us to ensure the timely delivery of all digital marketing work. This role requires operational excellence to drive client satisfaction.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Ensure timely delivery of all digital marketing work</li>\n  <li>Work with the team to coordinate deliverables</li>\n  <li>Ability to write content</li>\n  <li>Maintain regular communication to ensure client satisfaction and address concerns</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Administrative &amp; Operational Tasks</strong> </p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Generate and send accurate invoices in a timely manner</li>\n  <li>Maintain detailed records of client interactions and account status in CRM</li>\n  <li>Coordinate with internal teams to ensure seamless service delivery</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Team Development (As Needed)</strong> </p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Assist in recruitment and interview processes for account management team</li>\n  <li>Participate in onboarding and training of new team members</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Required Qualifications</strong> </p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Fluent English (written and verbal communication)</li>\n  <li><strong>2-3 years of delivery management </strong></li>\n  <li><strong>2-3 years experience of working with a team</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>2-3 years of experience in digital marketing</strong></li>\n  <li>Strong email communication and professional writing skills</li></ul>",
